OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get throw lines after rise
OL,4,Ain river rescues
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of police officers have
OL,7,Fundergone water safety training and
OL,8,Fbeen equipped with new throw lines
OL,9,Ffollowing an influx of "river-related
OL,10,Fincidents".
OL,12,FDurham Police said the reports had
OL,13,Finvolved mainly university students
OL,14,Fgoing into the water.
OL,16,FNeighbourhood officers from Durham city
OL,17,Fcentre, Crook and Barnard Castle have
OL,18,Fbeen training with the County Durham
OL,19,Fand Darlington Fire and Rescue Service
OL,20,F(CDDFRS) since July.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
