OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get throw lines after rise
OL,4,Ain river rescues
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighter Connor McCabe said giving
OL,7,Fthose first on scene confidence,
OL,8,Fknowledge and equipment until water
OL,9,Ftechnicians arrived gave them a better
OL,10,Fchance of rescuing somebody from the
OL,11,Fwater.
